// ezdxf.new(dxfversion, setup=False) creates (src/dxf_templates.inc, generated by
// scripts/gen_dxf_templates.py); layers, line types and entities are added as ezdxf adds
// them, and write() sets the initial view like ezdxf.zoom.extents.
